<title>USA: SIFCO sets special dividend of $0.10/shr.</title>
<headline>SIFCO sets special dividend of $0.10/shr.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SIFCO Industries Inc said on Monday its board has set a special one-time, year-end cash dividend of $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable October 24 on the company's common shares to shareholders of record on October 10.</p>
</text>
